    "growth": 1.18,
    "$specified": {
      "base": 450,
      "growth": 1.47,
      "$comment": "The v0.1 values. Day one produces about \u00a3200 against a \u00a3450 target, so every policy dies on encounter 1 and no metric is measurable. The achievable profit curve climbs about x98 across 24 encounters; 1.47 asks for x7,052. See REPORT.md."
    }
  },
